		<p class="Tablefootnotef" style="margin-top: 0in;  border: none; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: -5pt; margin-left: 24.0pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -24.0pt; padding: 0in; font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: TimesNewRomanPSStd-Regular; color: black;">____________</p><p class="Tablefootnote_f" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:10pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:10pt;">(1)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_0_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The Company generally acquires its investments in transactions not subject to registration under the Securities Act&#160;of&#160;1933, as amended (the &#8220;Securities Act&#8221;). These investments are generally subject to restrictions as &#8220;restricted securities&#8221; (within the meaning of the Securities Act). Unless otherwise noted, all securities were acquired in transactions not subject to registration under the Securities Act.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(2)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_15_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Fair value is determined in good faith by the Board of Directors of the Company.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(3)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_26_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">As of June&#160;30, 2026, the portfolio includes approximately $35.6&#160;million of principal amount of debt investments and 8,669,682 shares of preferred stock investments which contain an active payment<span class="nobreak">-in-kind</span> (&#8220;PIK&#8221;) provision.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(4)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_28_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Notes bear interest at variable rates and are subject to an interest rate floor where disclosed. The rate disclosed is as of June&#160;30, 2026.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(5)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_30_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Cost value reflects accretion of original issue discount or market discount, or amortization of premium.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(6)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_31_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Cost value reflects repayment of principal.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(7)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_32_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Non<span class="nobreak">-income</span> producing as of June&#160;30, 2026.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(8)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_34_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Aggregate gross unrealized appreciation for U.S.&#160;federal income tax purposes is $11,968,969; aggregate gross unrealized depreciation for U.S.&#160;federal income tax purposes is $158,793,228. Net unrealized depreciation is $146,824,259 based upon an estimated tax cost basis of $399,666,953 as of June&#160;30, 2026.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(9)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_36_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Cost reflects accretion of effective yield less any cash distributions received or entitled to be received from collateralized loan obligation (&#8220;CLO&#8221;) equity investments.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(10)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_1_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Totals may not sum due to rounding.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Text_flush" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:0;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;"><span class="Italic" style="font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;">(continued on next page)</span></p>
		<p class="Text_flush" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:0;widows:3;text-align:center;margin-top:8pt;">The accompanying notes are an integral part of these unaudited financial statements.</p>
		</div>

		<p class="LRH" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:center;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin: 10px 0px 10px 0pt; page-break-after: always; border-bottom: 1px solid; margin-top: 10.0pt; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 10.0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-align: center; font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Times New Roman PS Std, serif; color: black;">8</p>
		<p class="Text_flush" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:0;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><a href="#TOC001">Table of Contents</a></p>



	<div class="_idGenObjectStyleOverride-1" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;border-width:0pt;">
		<p class="H1" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:1;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:center;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:12pt;"><span class="Bold" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">OXFORD SQUARE CAPITAL CORP.</span></p>
		<p class="H2" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:0;widows:1;text-align:center;margin-top:12pt;"><span class="Bold" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">SCHEDULE OF INVESTMENTS (Unaudited) &#8212; (continued)<br/>June&#160;30, 2026</span></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;margin-top:8pt;">(11)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_2_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Indicates assets that the Company believes do not represent &#8220;qualifying assets&#8221; under Section&#160;55(a)&#160;of the Investment Company Act&#160;of&#160;1940, as amended (the &#8220;1940 Act&#8221;). The Company may include CLO equity side letter related investments within CLO equity subordinated notes line items, and those side letter related investments may represent qualifying assets under Section&#160;55(a)&#160;of the 1940 Act. Qualifying assets must represent at least 70% of the Company&#8217;s total assets at the time of acquisition of any additional non<span class="nobreak">-qualifying</span> assets. As of June&#160;30, 2026, the Company held qualifying assets that represented 69.4% of its total assets.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(12)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_4_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Investment not domiciled in the United&#160;States, however, the principal country of risk where this investment primarily has exposure is the United States.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(13)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_5_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Fair value includes the Company&#8217;s interest in subordinated fee notes and represents discounted cash flows associated with fees earned from CLO equity investments.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(14)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_6_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Aggregate investments represent greater than 5% of net assets.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(15)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_7_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The CLO equity investment was optionally redeemed. Expected value of residual distributions, once received, is anticipated to be recognized as return of capital, pending any remaining amortized cost, and/or realized gain for any amounts received in excess of such amortized cost.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(16)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_8_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The principal balance outstanding for this debt investment, in whole or in part, is indexed to 90<span class="nobreak">-day</span> SOFR.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(17)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_10_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">As of June&#160;30, 2026, this investment was on non<span class="nobreak">-accrual</span> status and no interest or dividend income has been recognized on this investment during the six&#160;months ended June&#160;30, 2026. The aggregate fair value of these investments was approximately $6.9&#160;million.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(18)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_12_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The CLO subordinated notes and income notes are considered equity positions in CLO vehicles. Equity investments are entitled to recurring distributions which are generally equal to the remaining cash flow of the payments made by the underlying fund&#8217;s securities less contractual payments to debt holders and fund expenses. The estimated yield indicated is based on the prior quarters ending investment cost (for previously existing portfolio investments) or the original cost for those investments made during the current quarter, as well as, a current projection of the future cash flows. Such projections are periodically reviewed and adjusted, and the estimated yield may not ultimately be realized.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(19)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_13_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Represents cash equivalents held in a money market fund as of June&#160;30, 2026.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(20)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_16_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The fair value of the investment was determined using significant unobservable inputs. See &#8220;Note&#160;4. Fair Value.&#8221;</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(21)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_18_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The Company&#8217;s SAFE (Simple Agreement for Future Equity) investment in Infinity Constellation Inc. is not debt (no&#160;stated interest or maturity) and provides the right to receive equity in the future upon a qualifying equity financing.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(22)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_19_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The investment is co<span class="nobreak">-invested</span> with the Company&#8217;s affiliates. See &#8220;Note&#160;7. Related Party Transactions.&#8221;</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(23)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_20_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The principal balance outstanding for this investment, in whole or in part, is indexed to 30<span class="nobreak">-day</span> SOFR.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(24)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_21_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Cost value reflects amortization.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(25)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_22_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">As of June&#160;30, 2026, the effective yield has been estimated to be 0%. The aggregate projected amount of future recurring distributions and terminal principal payment is less than the amortized investment cost.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Text_ind_center" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:center;text-indent:0;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">The accompanying notes are an integral part of these unaudited financial statements.</p>
		</div>

		<p class="RRH" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:center;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin: 10px 0px 10px 0pt; page-break-after: always; border-bottom: 1px solid; margin-top: 10.0pt; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 10.0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-align: center; font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Times New Roman PS Std, serif; color: black;">9</p>
