pany&#8217;s CLO equity subordinated and income notes of approximately $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c373" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="oxsq:IncomeFromSecuritizationVehiclesAndInvestment" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-27693">3.5</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million.</p>
